        "# MD-JSON Sync Quick Reference Guide\r",
        "\r",
        "## Basic Commands\r",
        "\r",
        "| Command | Description |\r",
        "|---------|-------------|\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js` | Run a one-time synchronization |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --watch` | Start continuous monitoring |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --watch --verbose` | Monitor with detailed logging |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --force` | Force synchronization regardless of conflicts |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --prefer-md` | Use Markdown as source of truth |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --prefer-json` | Use JSON as source of truth |\r",
        "| `node tydisync.js --config=custom-config.json` | Use custom configuration |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Windows Batch Files\r",
        "\r",
        "| File | Purpose |\r",
        "|------|---------|\r",
        "| `start-tydisync.bat` | Start with console output |\r",
        "| `start-tydisync-background.bat` | Run invisibly in background |\r",
        "| `add-to-startup.bat` | Add to Windows startup |\r",
        "\r",
        "## File Exclusion\r",
        "\r",
        "To exclude a file from synchronization, create a `.nosync` marker file:\r",
        "```\r",
        "touch filename.md.nosync\r",
        "```\r",
        "\r",
        "## Configuration (config.json)\r",
        "\r",
        "```json\r",
        "{\r",
        "  \"watchDirs\": [\r",
        "    { \"md\": \"./docs\", \"json\": \"./docs/json\" },\r",
        "    { \"md\": \"./shortlinks\", \"json\": \"./shortlinks/json\" }\r",
        "  ],\r",
        "  \"backupDir\": \"./backups\",\r",
        "  \"maxBackups\": 5,\r",
        "  \"enableBackups\": true,\r",
        "  \"conflictResolutionMethod\": \"timestamp\",\r",
        "  \"criticalFiles\": [\"memory.md\"]\r",
        "}\r",
        "```\r",
        "\r",
        "## Conflict Resolution Methods\r",
        "\r",
        "| Method | Description |\r",
        "|--------|-------------|\r",
        "| `timestamp` | Newer file wins |\r",
        "| `prefer-markdown` | Markdown file always wins |\r",
        "| `prefer-json` | JSON file always wins |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Log File\r",
        "\r",
        "Default log location: `./logs/md-json-sync.log`\r",
        "\r",
        "## Troubleshooting\r",
        "\r",
        "| Issue | Solution |\r",
        "|-------|----------|\r",
        "| Synchronization loop | Check for circular references or timestamp issues |\r",
        "| Missing JSON files | Ensure JSON directories exist and are writable |\r",
        "| Data loss in critical files | Check `.nosync` markers and critical files list |\r",
        "| Process not starting | Verify Node.js installation and file permissions |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Agent Responsibilities\r",
        "\r",
        "| Agent | Role |\r",
        "|-------|------|\r",
        "| Alpha | File monitoring |\r",
        "| Beta | Content transformation |\r",
        "| Gamma | Conflict resolution |\r",
        "| Delta | Safety (backups, locks) |\r",
        "| Epsilon | Process management |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Testing\r",
        "\r",
        "| Script | Purpose |\r",
        "|--------|---------|\r",
        "| `test-md-to-json.js` | Test Markdown to JSON conversion |\r",
        "| `test-json-to-md.js` | Test JSON to Markdown conversion |"
      ]
    }
  ],
